00:01:22.208 --> 00:01:23.728
Feedback beats guessing alone.

00:01:24.048 --> 00:01:25.950
Use the map in calls.

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:28.233
Update it when new objections appear.

00:01:28.233 --> 00:01:30.515
Remember the objective: map four objections.

